.SH BUGS
Text is strokes, not troff's text, so it prints in its own face.
.br
.IR Sketch 's
writes of the window's text are guarded by the window's
.BR seq ,
which other programs, such as
.IR hl (1),
also arm; if two arm it at once, a write can fail, and
.I Sketch
then asks for the text to be read again with
.B Sketch
twice.
A long text is written in pieces, as one Undo;
another program's edit between two pieces leaves part of it written.
.br
The thesis's instances, scalars and dimension lines, one-pass ordering,
and constraint button are not built yet.
